    "# Absurd Templates (abs)\n"
    "\n"
    "`abs` turns a directory of `.html` templates into **one self-contained Dart\n"
    "file**: each template becomes a typed function returning a `Fragment`, and\n"
    "`fragment.toHtml()` renders it. There is no runtime package and no template\n"
