    "## Find your way around\n"
    "\n"
    "Read `abs.yaml` in the project root first. It says where everything is:\n"
    "\n"
    "```yaml\n"
    "input: fragments                 # .html templates, scanned recursively\n"
    "output: lib/generated/html.dart  # the generated Dart file\n"
    "class: Html                      # entry class; Fragments when absent\n"
    "```\n"
    "\n"
    "The generated file is output, not source. Never edit it: the next `abs` run\n"
    "overwrites every change. Change the `.html` template, then regenerate.\n"
    "\n"
