    "## The edit loop\n"
    "\n"
    "1. Edit or create the `.html` file under the `input` directory.\n"
    "2. Run `abs check path/to/template.html`. It writes nothing and reports\n"
    "   syntax errors and Dart type errors with file, line, column and a caret\n"
    "   under the problem, in well under a second. Pass several files to check\n"
    "   them together; pass none to check every template.\n"
    "3. Fix what it reports and run it again until it prints `abs check: ... OK`.\n"
    "   It reports only the first syntax error of each template, so a clean\n"
