    "## Template syntax\n"
    "\n"
    "```html\n"
    "<x-props\n"
    "  title=\"String\"\n"
    "  users=\"List<({String name, bool active})>\"\n"
    "  footer=\"Fragment?\"\n"
    "></x-props>\n"
    "\n"
    "<section>\n"
    "  <h1>{{ title }}</h1>\n"
    "  <ul>\n"
    "    <x-for in=\"users\" as=\"user\" index-from=\"1\" index-as=\"number\">\n"
    "      <x-if case=\"user.active\">\n"
    "        <x-fragment template=\"/ui/user-item.html\" number=\"{{ number }}\" name=\"{{ user.name }}\" />\n"
    "      </x-if>\n"
    "    </x-for>\n"
    "  </ul>\n"
    "  {{ footer }}\n"
    "</section>\n"
    "```\n"
