    "## Calling fragments from Dart\n"
    "\n"
    "File paths become Dart names: directories become namespaces and file names\n"
    "become camelCase methods on the class from `abs.yaml`.\n"
    "\n"
    "| Template | Dart |\n"
    "|---|---|\n"
    "| `fragments/header.html` | `Html.header()` |\n"
    "| `fragments/pages/user-page.html` | `Html.pages.userPage(...)` |\n"
    "| `fragments/layout/primary.html` | `Html.layout.primary(...)` |\n"
