    "```dart\n"
    "import 'generated/html.dart'; // the `output` path from abs.yaml\n"
    "\n"
    "final html = Html.layout.primary(\n"
    "  title: 'Users',\n"
    "  content: Html.pages.users(\n"
    "    title: 'Users',\n"
    "    users: [(name: 'Ada', active: true)],\n"
    "    footer: Html.footer(),\n"
    "  ),\n"
    ").toHtml();\n"
    "```\n"
    "\n"
    "File and directory names must turn into valid, distinct Dart identifiers:\n"
    "`404.html`, `switch.html`, or both `user-page.html` and `user_page.html` in\n"
    "one directory are errors. Rename the file when `abs` reports a conflict.\n"
